<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">About WABE Mianwali</span>
      <h1>Do School Differently</h1>
      <p>We built The WABE International School, Mianwali Campus around a simple belief: children learn best when a school is calm, purposeful, and genuinely curious alongside them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon"><%- icon('target') %></div>
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>To deliver a rigorous, Federal Board-aligned education from Nursery through Class 10 that builds academically strong, digitally capable, and confident young people rooted in strong values.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon green"><%- icon('compass') %></div>
        <h3>Our Vision</h3>
        <p>To be Mianwali's model for "doing school differently" &mdash; a campus where curiosity, science, and communication are as central as textbooks and tests.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Philosophy</span>
      <h2>What "Do School Differently" Means</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4 ethos-grid">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon"><%- icon('book') %></div>
        <h4>Read & Question</h4>
        <p>Reading isn't passive here &mdash; students are taught to question, discuss, and connect what they read.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon green"><%- icon('mic') %></div>
        <h4>Speak with Confidence</h4>
        <p>Every grade gets structured opportunities to present, debate, and be heard.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon"><%- icon('bulb') %></div>
        <h4>Build & Innovate</h4>
        <p>From science fairs to coding basics, students are encouraged to make, not just memorize.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon green"><%- icon('heart') %></div>
        <h4>Care Beyond the Classroom</h4>
        <p>Guidance counseling and community service are part of the everyday school experience.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tinted">
  <div class="container grid grid-2" style="gap:48px;">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Story</span>
      <h2>Campus History</h2>
      <div class="timeline" style="margin-top:24px;">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h4>Founding &mdash; February 2025</h4>
          <p>The WABE International School, Mianwali Campus opens its doors, offering Nursery through Class 10 under the Federal Board curriculum from day one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h4>Building the Campus</h4>
          <p>Dedicated science and computer labs are set up to support hands-on, digital-first learning.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h4>Guidance & Professional Development</h4>
          <p>A dedicated Guidance & Development office is established for students and staff alike.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Core Values</span>
      <h2>What We Stand For</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:24px;">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><%- icon('heart') %></div>
          <h4>Care</h4>
          <p>Every student is known, not just enrolled.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon green"><%- icon('award') %></div>
          <h4>Excellence</h4>
          <p>High standards, applied consistently.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><%- icon('shield') %></div>
          <h4>Integrity</h4>
          <p>Doing right even when no one is watching.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon green"><%- icon('users') %></div>
          <h4>Community</h4>
          <p>School, family, and neighborhood, working together.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <div class="card testimonial reveal" style="text-align:left;">
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;">"We didn't want to build another exam factory. We wanted a school where children are genuinely excited to ask questions &mdash; and where teachers have the room to answer them properly."</p>
      <div class="who">&mdash; A Note from the Principal</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <div>
        <h2>Come See the Campus for Yourself</h2>
        <p>Book a visit or begin your admission application today.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-band-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn" style="background:var(--white); color:var(--green-700);">Book a Visit</a>
        <a href="/admissions" class="btn btn-outline-light">Apply Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
